@startuml Macro Manager
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "User" as User

package "Macro Manager System" {
  usecase "Scan Candy Item" as UC1
  usecase "Handle Unknown Object" as UC2
  usecase "Handle Camera Error" as UC3
  usecase "Adjust Webcam Resolution" as UC4 <<New>>
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4

note right of UC1
  <b>Winning Scenario</b>
  User holds candy item. System
  detects it and displays info.
end note

note right of UC2
  <b>Losing Scenario</b>
  User holds non-food item.
  Fails detection.
end note

note right of UC3
  <b>Invalid Scenario</b>
  No webcam detected.
  Catches IOError.
end note

note right of UC4
  <color:blue><b>(New Requirement)</b></color>
  <color:blue>User increases resolution</color> 
  <color:blue>in run_webcam.py to improve</color> 
  <color:blue>model detection accuracy.</color>
end note

@enduml